e-within-20-days-a-key-measure-of-cyanobacteria-fell-nearly-90-and-ammonia-nitrogen-dropped-sharply/articleshow/133887812.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-07T22:12:45+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133888784,imgsize-1533586.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Meet Callum Smith: The armless racer, 23, steering with his feet and chasing a historic Le Mans debut]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133888683.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Callum Smith, 23, was born without arms but is now pursuing a racing career by steering with his feet. Having crossed 110mph on track, he has joined Team BRIT and is working towards his racing licence. Alongside quadruple amputee Harvey Phillips, Smith hopes to help the team achieve its historic Le Mans ambition.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/meet-callum-smith-the-23-year-old-armless-racing-driver-who-steers-with-his-feet-at-110mph-joins-team-brit-alongside-quadruple-amputee-harvey-phillips-and-targets-a-historic-le-mans-debut/articleshow/133888683.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/meet-callum-smith-the-23-year-old-armless-racing-driver-who-steers-with-his-feet-at-110mph-joins-team-brit-alongside-quadruple-amputee-harvey-phillips-and-targets-a-historic-le-mans-debut/articleshow/133888683.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-07T21:52:42+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133888917,imgsize-111189.cms"/></item></channel></rss>